{"find": "[[caption]] Fight with the Cannibals.", "replace": "[[caption]] Fight with the Cannibals.\n\n[[cont]]stand behind their palisade, from which we cleared them, and scattered them in full retreat before us. I completed the punishment by burning their houses and capturing their live stock, and then camped on an island opposite, for the night, keeping a careful watch till the morning, when we resumed our way up river."}